{"id":"n14763-1-10","stage":3,"title":"아이디어 · 主意","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14763-1-10-1","ko":"이번 행사에서 장기 자랑 대회를 하는 게 어때?","zh":"这次活动办个才艺展示比赛怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"행사에서","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행사에서","audio":"/audio/08c92bc4e74a18a1dcf0.mp3"}},{"text":"장기","meaning":"特长","explanation":"장기：特长。","readings":[{"term":"장기","audio":"/audio/994fc13bf34735a1ab00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75048","senseId":"1","lemma":"장기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장기","audio":"/audio/994fc13bf34735a1ab00.mp3"}},{"text":"자랑","meaning":"炫耀，夸耀","explanation":"자랑：炫耀，夸耀。","readings":[{"term":"자랑","audio":"/audio/c5856cd5869c0b7021b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24772","senseId":"1","lemma":"자랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랑","audio":"/audio/c5856cd5869c0b7021b3.mp3"}},{"text":"대회를","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대회를","audio":"/audio/49d5a936e8d3919d1f10.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"9fbe110d36cda8cf","term":"행사","zh":"活动，仪式，典礼","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3","entryId":"72482","definition":"有目的或计划地按程序做某事；或指该事。","pronunciation":["행사"]},{"id":"994fc13bf34735a1","term":"장기","zh":"特长","audio":"/audio/994fc13bf34735a1ab00.mp3","entryId":"75048","definition":"特别擅长的才能。","pronunciation":["장끼"]},{"id":"c5856cd5869c0b70","term":"자랑","zh":"炫耀，夸耀","audio":"/audio/c5856cd5869c0b7021b3.mp3","entryId":"24772","definition":"向别人说或显摆自己或和自己有关的人或物等值得被称赞的事。","pronunciation":["자랑"]},{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회","대ː훼"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9cc3f7ce91a5b67a4c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14763-1-10-2","ko":"그거 좋은 아이디어인데? 사람들이 좋아할 거야.","zh":"那是个好主意呢，大家应该会喜欢的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"아이디어인데?","meaning":"主意，创意","explanation":"아이디어：主意，创意；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"아이디어","audio":"/audio/f5aba79c06a9e94bb020.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14763","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이디어인데","audio":"/audio/df9e6cb22e78f3463046.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아할","meaning":"喜欢，喜爱","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢，喜爱；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"2","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아할","audio":"/audio/05cf085690511a73796d.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"f5aba79c06a9e94b","term":"아이디어","zh":"主意，创意","audio":"/audio/f5aba79c06a9e94bb020.mp3","entryId":"14763","definition":"新颖奇特的想法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢，喜爱","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"希望享受着做。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd149b4e7bf73815309f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14763","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次活动办个才艺展示比赛怎么样？","那是个好主意呢，大家应该会喜欢的。","你怎么蜷缩着还捂着耳朵？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次活动办个才艺展示比赛怎么样？","那是个好主意呢，大家应该会喜欢的。","你怎么蜷缩着还捂着耳朵？"],"answer":1}]}
